    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Calibrator is a tool to allow you to use multiple vendors' devices together in SteamVR! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use full body trackers with Meta Quest / Pico VR headsets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Valve Index Controllers with Meta Quest / Pico VR headsets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Vive Ultimate Trackers with SteamVR headsets (e.g. Valve Index). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Calibration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calibrate play spaces by moving a controller and a tracker together in an infinity sign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous calibration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach a tracker on your VR headset to align play spaces together automatically. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.poster.avif?t=1739530850\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.webm?t=1739530850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.mp4?t=1739530850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Calibrator is a tool to allow you to use multiple vendors' devices together in SteamVR! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use full body trackers with Meta Quest / Pico VR headsets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Valve Index Controllers with Meta Quest / Pico VR headsets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Vive Ultimate Trackers with SteamVR headsets (e.g. Valve Index). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Calibration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calibrate play spaces by moving a controller and a tracker together in an infinity sign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous calibration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach a tracker on your VR headset to align play spaces together automatically. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.poster.avif?t=1739530850\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.webm?t=1739530850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368750/extras/89066bf84cd41f997e2c9c5381665b93.mp4?t=1739530850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
